{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"stefan boltzmann radiation law stefan boltzmann radiation law","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","fileName":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:55\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Conduction Convection and Radiation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Conduction Convection and Radiation","Surface Emissivity and Absorptivity","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"stefan boltzmann radiation law stefan boltzmann radiation law","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","fileName":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law","heading":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Any body above absolute zero emits thermal radiation. The net radiative heat rate between a surface and its surroundings is proportional to area, emissivity, the Stefan-Boltzmann constant, and the difference of their absolute temperatures raised to the fourth power.\n\nThe fourth-power dependence makes radiation increasingly important at high temperature and makes the governing equation nonlinear. Correct use requires Kelvin temperatures and credible [[Surface Emissivity and Absorptivity|surface optical properties]], not merely the temperature difference used in a convection relation.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Conduction Convection and Radiation","Surface Emissivity and Absorptivity","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"stefan boltzmann radiation law stefan boltzmann radiation law","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","fileName":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Stefan-Boltzmann Radiation Law","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Conduction Convection and Radiation","Surface Emissivity and Absorptivity","cosmolheattransfermodels.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}